What are RTD Flavoured Beverages?
Ready-to-drink (RTD) flavoured beverages are pre-mixed drinks designed for immediate consumption without preparation. This category encompasses a diverse range of products including tea, coffee, energy drinks, yogurt-based beverages, and functional drinks with added vitamins or probiotics. The convenience factor makes them particularly appealing to today's fast-paced consumers who prioritize speed and portability in their beverage choices.
